<h1>Specialty food wholesale from the Quayside</h1>
<p>Harbor Lane Provisions supplies 1,265 independent grocers, cafes and restaurants with coffee, oils, preserves, cheese and bakery lines from 27 producers. Order by 4 pm for next-day delivery.</p>
<h2>The Autumn Harvest range</h2>
<p>Eight seasonal lines, from the <a href="https://harborlane.example/catalog/HLP-CF-105">Autumn Harvest spiced roast</a> blended by Northwind Coffee Roasters to <a href="https://harborlane.example/catalog/HLP-HN-305">apple butter</a> and <a href="https://harborlane.example/catalog/HLP-CN-905">squash soup</a>. Order by 15 October to secure your share of the harvest.</p>
<img src="https://cdn.harborlane.example/images/quayside-at-dawn.jpg" alt="The Quayside warehouse at dawn" width="480" height="300">
<h2>Our new cold room</h2>
<p>Cold room 3 opened in April and keeps 140 pallets of cheese and dairy at 2 C.</p>
<img src="https://harborlane.example/images/cold-room-installation.png" alt="Cold room 3" width="400" height="250">
